          "items": [
            "🌴 Unwind at 30A Blue Retreat<br><br>A perfect blend of coastal charm and modern comfort, designed for a relaxed yet sophisticated beachside escape.<br><br>✨ Why You’ll Love It<br>☀️ Open, sunlit spaces with sleek, modern finishes<br>🌊 Breezy private deck overlooking the pool & spa<br>🏝️ Located in a private community<br>🚶‍♀️ Direct access to the Beachwood Villas beach access<br>🚲 2 adult bikes included — perfect for cruising along 30A<br>💕 Perfect for a romantic getaway or family retreat (sleeps up to 6)<br><br>🛏️ Sleeping Arrangements<br>👑 Master Bedroom: Plush king bed, 55\" TV, down duvet & soft linens<br>🚪 Private patio access from the master with poolside views<br>🛌 Guest Bedroom: Full bed + cozy bunk beds<br>📺 43\" TV in guest room<br>💤 All beds feature soft linens & duvet covers<br>🛁 Bathrooms (Newly Renovated!)<br>🚿 Master bath with walk-in shower<br>🛁 Guest bath with tub/shower combo<br>🧴 Fluffy white towels & soaps provided<br><br>🍽️ Living & Dining<br>🛋️ Warm, inviting first-floor open-concept layout<br>👩‍🍳 Modern kitchen with island seating<br>🍳 Fully stocked kitchen: fridge, microwave, toaster, dishwasher<br>☕ Coffee maker + Keurig<br>🍽️ Spacious dining area for family meals & gatherings<br>🌴 Outdoor Living<br>🌅 Private patio steps from the master bedroom<br>🌊 Pool & spa views<br>☕ Shaded breakfast table by the pool<br>🌴 Surrounded by mature palm trees<br><br>📍 Prime Location<br>🍤 A couple blocks to Cafe Thirty-A<br>🦞 Reel ‘Em In Seafood nearby<br>🍕 Brozinni’s Pizzeria close by<br>🚲 Only 1.5 miles to Seaside<br><br>The ultimate charming coastal escape — where comfort, location, and relaxation come together beautifully. 🌊✨",
